  "description": "Standalone metadata inspector for .NET assemblies — explore types, methods, fields, signatures, and IL bytecode. Interactive REPL plus one-shot mode; per-table drill-down, cross-table find, type and method scoped views, IL disassembly. Useful for diagnosing obfuscation results, comparing builds, or just reading bytecode without firing up a full decompiler. Community edition (default, no key required): REPL, --summary, --table, --type, --method, --il, --metadata, --filter, --find, --dependencies. Enterprise edition (paid, requires the same DEMEANOR_LICENSE key as Wise Owl Demeanor): adds --query natural-language queries, --diff assembly comparison, --mcp Model Context Protocol server, and --json structured output for tooling. Pricing and purchase: https://www.wiseowlsoftware.com/pricing.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
